@startuml
title Daily RAG index update and evaluation

actor Scheduler
database "Source folder / repository" as Source
component "update_index.py" as Update
component "Parser + chunker" as Chunk
component "Embedding model" as Embed
database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
database "BM25/Tantivy" as BM25
database "logs.jsonl" as Logs
component "evaluate.py + golden set" as Eval

Scheduler -> Update: daily run
Update -> Source: scan and fingerprint
Source --> Update: new/changed files
Update -> Chunk: parse and split
Chunk -> Embed: create vectors
Embed -> Qdrant: upsert chunks + metadata
Chunk -> BM25: update text index
Update -> Logs: write update result
Eval -> Qdrant: run golden questions
Eval -> Logs: write request metrics

@enduml
